    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "SMITHCURLEY estate agents; Excellent opportunity to acquire a superb three bedroomed semi detached house with the added benefit of external insulation wrapping works completed. This property comes on the market not overlooked to the front and boast a lovely sunny rear garden. Situated in a small cul de sac with ample parking this is one not to be missed and an early viewing is highly recommended.\r\n\r\nPrime location within a stroll of Lucan Village, shops, schools, sports and leisure facilities. Public transport is also well catered for to and from the city centre. SuperValu and Liffey Valley shopping centres are also close by. The M50 is close by allowing easy access to all major routeways.\r\n\r\nAccommodation briefly comprises hallway, livingroom, kitchen/diningroom, three bedrooms and main bathroom. Outside are lovely landscaped front and rear gardens with a large purpose built storage shed."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance porch:\tSliding patio door, tiled flooring.\r\n\r\nHallway:\t\t\tTimber flooring.\r\n\r\nLivingroom: 14’9’’ x 12’4’’ (4.57m x 3.80m)\r\n\t\t\t\tFeature fireplace with marble hearth, built in wall units with shelving, timber flooring.\r\n \r\nKitchen/dining room: 15’1’’ x 11’’1’’ (4.62m x 3.40m)\r\n\t\t\t\tExcellent range of wall and floor units, cooker, extractor hood, plumbed for washing machine, part wall and part floor tiling, part timber flooring, understairs storage, door to rear garden.\r\n\r\nCloaks:\t\t\tShelving.\r\n\r\nLanding:\t\t\tHotpress, shelving.\r\n\r\nStorage:\t\t\tShelving.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 10’8’’ x 9’2’’ (3.32m x 2.83m)\r\n\t\t\t\tBuilt in wardrobes with mirrored units.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 12’2’’ x 7’4’’ (3.72m x 2.27m)\r\n\t\t\t\tBuilt in wardrobes, varnished tongue and groove flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 8’9’’ x 7’3’’ (2.72m x 2.24m)\r\n\t\t\t\tBuilt in wardrobes, varnished tongue and groove flooring.\r\n\r\nBathroom: 8’1’’ x 6’1’’ (2.48m x 1.86m)\r\n\t\t\t\tW.c, w.h.b with storage unit, bath with Tritan shower, fully tiled walls and flooring, shelving.\r\n\r\n\r\nOutside:\r\nFront Garden:         Mostly in grass, off road parking, not overlooked to the front.\r\n\r\nRear garden:\t\tLovely sunny rear garden, fully walled, mostly in grass, raised flower bed, mature plants, patio area, outside light, garden shed.\r\n\r\nAdvised minimum value: €405,000 to include all flooring, light fittings, blinds, garden shed, cooker, extractor fan and undercounter fridge.\r\n\r\n\r\nViewing by appointment contact 01-6249131.\r\n\r\nPSR License Number: 001676\r\n\r\n\r\nMessers. SmithCurley Estate Agents for themselves and for the vendors or lessors of the property whose agents they are, give notice that, the particulars are set out as a general outline for the guidance of intending purchasers or lessees, and do not constitute part of, an offer or contract. All descriptions, dimensions, references to condition and necessary permissions for use and occupation, other details are given in good faith and are believed to be correct, but any intending purchasers or tenants should not rely on them as statements or representations of fact but must satisfy themselves by inspection or otherwise as to the correctness of each of them. No person in the employment of SmithCurley has any authority to make or give representation or warranty whatever in relation to this development."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Spacious accommodation c.85sq.m\r\nPrime location close to Lucan Village in St Mary’s Parish\r\nPresented in excellent condition \r\nExternal insulation wrapping\r\nDouble glazed windows\r\nCul de sac\r\nAlarmed\r\nGas fire central heating\r\nUpgraded gas boiler\r\nUpgraded fuse board\r\nNot overlooked to the front\r\nFully walled sunny rear garden\r\nEntrance porch\r\nFully tiled bathroom\r\nAttic with pull down ladder\r\nViewing is highly recommended\r\nBER C2"
      },
